Subject: [PATCH] Trabis: accountant package + portal use Total = Netto +
 Zahllast (same as the month saldo)

- trabis-package.js: summary total = saldoNet + zahllast; Excel/PDF labels updated.
- buchhalter.html: Zahllast shown as an amount with "zu zahlen"/"Guthaben",
  Total = Saldo netto + Zahllast.
- CHANGES_FOR_BACKEND.md: step 7.

